#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tf02-lidar.rst:81
#: 143e98dc142045c2821667e023cd3718
msgid ""
"For a serial connection you can use any spare Serial/UART port.  The diagram"
" below shows how to connect a TF02 to Serial2.  Please note that wire "
"colours may vary by model so please check the datasheet"
msgstr ""
"串口连接可使用任何空闲的串口/UART 端口。下图显示如何将 TF02 连接到 Serial2。请注意，不同型号的线缆颜色可能不同，请查阅数据手册。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tf02-lidar.rst:87
#: 913efca5845647f6b5c04960b37bb897
msgid "The diagram below shows how to connect a TF03 to Serial2"
msgstr "下图显示如何将 TF03 连接到 Serial2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tf02-lidar.rst:93
#: 69683ea219b44116a95dd85f418ea3d5
msgid "The diagram below shows how to connect a TF-Nova to Serial2"
msgstr "下图显示如何将 TF-Nova 连接到 Serial2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tf02-lidar.rst:99
#: d438e51c976e45cda2bc89883331c949
msgid ""
"If SERIAL2 is being used then the following parameters should be set for the"
" first rangefinder:"
msgstr "如果使用 SERIAL2，应为第一个测距仪设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tf02-lidar.rst:101
#: 328a3cb2f3f94d0ba6ca8a6ceadd7695
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (Lidar)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9（激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tf02-lidar.rst:102
#: 788cd833dc554deeb44f038180961bcb
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115 (115200 baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115（115200 波特率）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tf02-lidar.rst:103
#: f48750167c274c6fbc08fffcd88de54e
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 19 (Benewake TF02) for TF02, 27 "
"(Benewake TF03) for TF02-Pro, TF03, TFS20-L, TF-Luna, TF-Nova, TF350"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 19（Benewake TF02）用于 TF02，27（Benewake "
"TF03）用于 TF02-Pro、TF03、TFS20-L、TF-Luna、TF-Nova、TF350"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tf02-lidar.rst:104
#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tf02-lidar.rst:122
#: 169b3b42b4c84721ab2ff98b86bcab56 c1e846a0fac049c4aa12ff5fd048593a
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.1"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tf02-lidar.rst:105
#: ae39086d73134cf88fc78c52df0b55ca
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>`: for TF02 use **20** for indoor, **10** for"
" outdoor.  For TF03 use **100** for indoor, **50** for outdoor.  Please see "
"table at top of this page for other sensors. *This is the distance in meters"
" that the rangefinder can reliably read.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>`：TF02 室内使用 **20**，室外使用 **10**。TF03 室内使用 "
"**100**，室外使用 **50**。其他传感器请参见本页顶部的表格。*这是测距仪可以可靠读取的距离（米）。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tf02-lidar.rst:106
#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tf02-lidar.rst:124
#: 0a9869d16fe2434880f6b34d02582d15 1c7032f80f304248a6927ddedc0ac254
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 *or more accurately the "
"distance in metres from the range finder to the ground when the vehicle is "
"landed.  This value depends on how you have mounted the rangefinder.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 "
"*或更精确地，飞行器降落时测距仪到地面的距离（米）。该值取决于测距仪的安装方式。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tf02-lidar.rst:109
#: ddcb2eb8b1e04a7cb53d9a0e511f883b
msgid "Connecting via CAN"
msgstr "CAN 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tf02-lidar.rst:111
#: 37a1fdc9bbf14cc49dbc8e5e08af7fad
msgid ""
"The TF02-i, TF03, TFmini-i and TF350 can be connected to the autopilot via "
"CAN1.  The diagram below shows how to connect a TF03 to CAN1.  Please note "
"that wire colours may vary by model so please check the datasheet."
msgstr ""
"TF02-i、TF03、TFmini-i 和 TF350 可通过 CAN1 连接到飞控。下图显示如何将 TF03 连接到 "
"CAN1。请注意，不同型号的线缆颜色可能不同，请查阅数据手册。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tf02-lidar.rst:117
#: e955140dbb944006ba0a35697ce5da60
msgid "If CAN1 is used then set the following parameters:"
msgstr "如果使用 CAN1，请设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tf02-lidar.rst:119
#: fab5f2d44f074146a1da3c82f832b9a3
msgid ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (First driver)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（第一驱动）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tf02-lidar.rst:120
#: 3820b2d5331440f690187fc3056a579f
msgid ":ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 11 (Benewake)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 11（Benewake）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tf02-lidar.rst:121
#: 02704f0efd814ab789bc3288d8fed66c
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 34 (Benewake CAN)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 34（Benewake CAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tf02-lidar.rst:123
#: d246b820a5a4417093525a41023f043b
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>`: for TF02-i use **40** for indoor, **13** "
"for outdoor.  For TF03 use **100** for indoor, **50** for outdoor.  Please "
"see table at top of this page for other sensors. *This is the distance in "
"meters that the rangefinder can reliably read.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>`：TF02-i 室内使用 **40**，室外使用 **13**。TF03 室内使用 "
"**100**，室外使用 **50**。其他传感器请参见本页顶部的表格。*这是测距仪可以可靠读取的距离（米）。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-benewake-tf02-lidar.rst:127
#: 9f7ae4c657b5470e9f8c6cf61597d646
